<div class="sect">FORM AN ARMADA</div><div class="rrow"><input id="aname" placeholder="Armada name (optional)" maxlength="24"><button class="btn sm" data-cact="aform">FORM</button></div>
      <div class="rrow"><input id="ainv" placeholder="Captain online (creates Armada)" maxlength="20"><button class="btn sm" data-cact="ainv2">INVITE</button></div>
      <div class="dim small">An Armada is a short co-op group of up to <%~ it.ARMADAMax %> captains, each with their own wingmates. Members and their wingmates can't hurt each other and show in green. You get a private chat (/a), +5% shield recharge and bounties while another member shares your system, a share of each other's bounties and kill credit, Armada contracts, co-op Holdouts, and a rescue window if your ship goes down. It disbands when everyone has been offline for <%~ it.ARMADAIdleMin %> minutes.</div>